+     * @field block.typeSub
+     * Block sub-type for the operation.  It's definition depends on block.type.
+     * Unused in IOBlockStorageDriver.
+     * @field request.byteStart
+     * Starting byte offset for the data transfer.
+     * @param request.buffer
